request: Rename Todo.done to Todo.completed everywhere. --single

single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/format.ts, src/commands.test.ts, src/format.test.ts, src/storage.test.ts, src/types.test.ts  (Renamed the Todo field done to completed in types.ts, commands.ts and format.ts, and in the test fixtures that build Todo objects. I kept ListOptions.includeDone as it is because it's a list option, not a Todo field. Note: todos.json files saved before this change still use "done", and load() doesn't migrate them, so old completed items will show as not completed.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 1: accept  (Oracle green; Todo.done renamed to Todo.completed across source and tests.)

